# Backend rules sync

Update matching rules when you change behavior in the same task.

| If you edit | Update |
|-------------|--------|
| `src/api/**/schema.json`, `src/components/**` | `content-model.mdc`, `api-contract.mdc` |
| Controllers, routes, custom serializers | `api-contract.mdc` |
| `config/plugins.ts` (i18n, upload) | `strapi-backend.mdc` |
| Seed / migration scripts | `content-model.mdc` |

## Frontend (same PR when contract changes)

| Backend change | Frontend |
|----------------|----------|
| Page or nav field names / shape | `src/core/types/page.ts`, `navigation.ts` |
| REST paths or query params | `src/core/data/adapters/strapi.adapter.ts`, `src/core/data/strapi/**` |
| Cache tag format | `src/core/data/cache-tags.ts` + revalidation routes (`app/api/revalidate`, `app/api/webhooks/strapi`) |
| New block types in CMS | Tenant `blocks/index.ts` + `catalog.mdc` (frontend) |
| Mock parity / seed source | `src/core/mock-data.ts/**` (required for mock tenants; vukans-bike uses it for `seed:vukans-bike`) |

## Monorepo

Repo root `.cursor/rules/monorepo.mdc` — keep backend rules path current.

## Completion check

Schema or API changes without updated `content-model.mdc` / `api-contract.mdc` (and frontend types/adapter when needed) = incomplete.
